# Wallpaper: U29 output 2Y (WRITE) stuck at 1: every page cell is written as it comes round, from the
# write bus: the last key's code (before the first key, whatever the undriven keyboard lines read), or
# spaces while Clear is held.
machine typewriter
title "Wallpaper"
brief "The whole screen is one character over and over, and each key typed fills the screen with that key. Clear blanks it only while it is held."
fault stuck U29.2Y 1
